l3: Check the function bodies in the extensions manager

stevedore types an extension's obj as optional, but the constructor
already rejects any extension whose obj is not an L3AgentExtension.
Iterate the extensions through one helper that narrows obj with the
same isinstance check, so mypy can check the four notifiers.

